{"id":"40e368f900e65306","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness.md","title":"Incompleteness from Normality and Stability","display":"thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness — Incompleteness from Normality and Stability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness — Incompleteness from Normality and Stability","source":"第 XI 章 p. 127，Theorem 2（PDF 144）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness — Incompleteness from Normality and Stability"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 127，Theorem 2（PDF 144）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd433626d0825ffc\" href=\"?note=bd433626d0825ffc\" title=\"92-df-normal-stable-system\">92-df-normal-stable-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type1}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Type1}(M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalSys}(M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StableSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{StableSys}(M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in S\">\\(\\gamma\\in S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\gamma\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_M B\\gamma)\\in P\">\\((\\gamma\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_M B\\gamma)\\in P\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}stable\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\gamma\\notin P\\land\\neg_M\\gamma\\notin P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}stable\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\gamma\\notin P\\land\\neg_M\\gamma\\notin P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in P\">\\(\\gamma\\in P\\)</span>，Normal 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\gamma\\in P\">\\(B\\gamma\\in P\\)</span>；固定点与 Type 1 的命题推理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_M B\\gamma\\in P\">\\(\\neg_M B\\gamma\\in P\\)</span>，继而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in P\">\\(f\\in P\\)</span>，矛盾。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_M\\gamma\\in P\">\\(\\neg_M\\gamma\\in P\\)</span>，固定点与经典逻辑给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\gamma\\in P\">\\(B\\gamma\\in P\\)</span>，Stable 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in P\">\\(\\gamma\\in P\\)</span>，同样矛盾。这只使用一个负可证性固定点，不要求整个结构中每个公式都有固定点，也不要求 P2/P3。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 XI 章 p. 127，Theorem 2（PDF 144）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-normal-stable-system","status":"resolved","id":"bd433626d0825ffc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type1}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormalSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StableSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"(\\gamma\\leftrightarrow_M\\neg_M B\\gamma)\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}abstract\\text{-}stable\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\gamma\\notin P\\land\\neg_M\\gamma\\notin P.","display":true},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"B\\gamma\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_M B\\gamma\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_M\\gamma\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"B\\gamma\\in P","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in P","display":false}],"bytes":1398,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-abstract-provability-system]] → [[92-df-normal-stable-system]] → [[92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"98b1207c207b95df","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"相对 ω 相容加枚举条件给出 Stable，并由 Type1 给出 Con。因而 [[92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness]] 的全部条件成立，得到 ¬γ∉P（同时也得 γ∉P）。这精确对应原书 Theorem 2A 的两个分开的结论。"},{"id":"56ec8377fc84ab9d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"固定点只要求在 T 中成立，未要求在 P 中可证；也不需要 Type1、Normal、P2/P3。它是原书抽象 Tarski–Gödel 语义路线，与 [[92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness]] 的可证固定点路线条件不同。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-261","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-abstract-stable-incompleteness]]"}],"outgoing":["bd433626d0825ffc"]}